er</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Script: Oscar Zapata</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Art: Malva_mart, Eider Art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backgrounds: みんちりえ</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: Rafael Dzib Chérrez, Agustín Ruiz</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publishing: Mangotronics</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The Devil's Whisper is a psychological horror Visual Novel with a full voice cast. Immerse yourself in a haunting mystery filled with dark drama and a touch of romance. Multiple thrilling alternate endings to play through! Choose who lives and who dies!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862280/header.jpg?t=1787112447", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862280/2986a7f30718e0197d79996ff571c6a6f2c147f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787112447", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862280/2986a7f30718e0197d79996ff571c6a6f2c147f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787112447", "website": "https://mangotronics.com/press/sheet.php?p=thedevilswhisper", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 8.1/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4340 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Compatible OpenGL/VRAM 512 MB or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> same as most RPG Maker MZ specs</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Compatible OpenGL